---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ClaimRejectionQuiz from '../components/ClaimRejectionQuiz.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Client Support Services" description="Insurance support services: claims, policy revival, ombudsman.">
  <main id="main" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Client Support Services</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12">Rejected Claims, Stuck Claims, Policy Revival, Lost Documents, Ombudsman, Renewal. Get help with all your insurance support needs.</p>

    <ClaimRejectionQuiz />

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">How We Can Help You</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8 text-lg text-slate-700">
        <p>Facing issues with your insurance policy or a rejected claim can be frustrating. Our expert team specializes in navigating the complexities of the insurance landscape to provide you with comprehensive support. We assist with:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
          <li>**Claim Rejection Recovery:** Analyzing rejection reasons and guiding you through the appeal process.</li>
          <li>**Stuck Claims:** Expediting claims that are delayed by insurers.</li>
          <li>**Policy Revival:** Assisting with the revival of lapsed life insurance policies.</li>
          <li>**Lost Documents:** Guidance on obtaining duplicate policy documents.</li>
          <li>**IRDAI & Ombudsman Complaints:** Representing your case before regulatory bodies.</li>
          <li>**Policy Renewals & Reviews:** Ensuring your policies are up-to-date and optimized.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Don't face insurance challenges alone. Contact us today for personalized assistance.</p>
        <div class="text-center mt-12">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold rounded-full text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Get Direct Support
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>